:: Desert Village Pay
You pay the man and he hands you a key. "First room on the right. As soon as you leave I'll be taking the key back. I want you up and out by 6 AM."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Misland Inn]]>><<set $desertinn to 1>><</link>>

