<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
<<ejaculation>>
The <<people>> finish and put their clothes back on <<his>> clothes. “That should about cover the rest.” <<He>> grins a crooked smile and walks away leaving you to tearfully gather yourself.
<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
