You send one final punch to the <<personsimple>>'s face and <<he>> falls back momentarily stunned. You contemplate attacking again but before you see even more crew rush onto the deck. You retreat and jump overboard swimming the rest of the way.
<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
