:: Ice Shrine
Deep inside the hole you find an opening. A small shrine fills the room, lighting it up with small glowing bulbs.
<br><br>
<<link [[Pray|Ice Shrine Pray]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave (0:10)|Misland]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Ice Shrine Pray
<<if $phase is 1>>
	You sit on a mat and bow your head.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $phase is 2 and $ghost is 1>>
	You pray for salvation. Your thoughts drift to your hopes for the future, and how things could be better.
	<br><br>
	An hour passes, but you're overcome by a tingling sensation.
	<br><br>
	<<set Skin.color.natural to "ice">>
	<<set V.transformationParts.ghost.hitodama to "disabled">>
    <<set V.transformationParts.ghost.mist to "default">>
	<<set $haircolour to "snowblue">>
	<<set $hairfringecolour to "snowblue">>
    <<set $makeup.browscolour to "snowblue">>
	<<set $options.lightGlow to 1>>
	<<set $ghost to 2>>
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	You pray for salvation. Your thoughts drift to your hopes for the future, and how things could be better.
	<br><br>
	An hour passes, and you feel less burdened.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Pray for salvation (1:00)|Ice Shrine Pray]]>>
	<<pass 60>><<set $phase to 2>>
	<<if $purity gte ((1000 / 7) * 7)>>
		<<stress -6>><<awareness -2>><<arousal -1200>>
	<<elseif $purity gte ((1000 / 7) * 6)>>
		<<stress -6>><<awareness -1>><<arousal -1000>>
	<<elseif $purity gte ((1000 / 7) * 5)>>
		<<stress -5>><<awareness -1>><<arousal -800>>
	<<elseif $purity gte ((1000 / 7) * 4)>>
		<<stress -4>><<awareness -1>><<arousal -600>>
	<<elseif $purity gte ((1000 / 7) * 3)>>
		<<stress -3>><<awareness -1>><<arousal -500>>
	<<elseif $purity gte ((1000 / 7) * 2)>>
		<<stress -2>><<awareness -1>><<arousal -400>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress -1>><<awareness -1>><<arousal -300>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave (0:10)|Misland]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Anthill
<<if $sandmound is 1>>
    <<set $outdoors to 1>><<effects>>
    You reach the mouth of a deep hole into the sand. It stretches down into the dark with no end in sight.
<<elseif $sandmound is 2>>
    <<set $outdoors to 0>><<effects>>
    You're in the mouth of the anthill. Loud crunches echo from deep in the hive.
<<elseif $sandmound is 3>>
    <<set $outdoors to 0>><<effects>>
    You're in the mouth of the anthill. You feel like you're about halfway through. Tunnels stretch in every direction with no end in sight.
<<elseif $sandmound is 4>>
    <<set $outdoors to 0>><<effects>>
    You're deep in the hill. The sound of writhing and scuttering surrounds you. The tunnels increase in number even further.
<<elseif $sandmound is 5>>
    <<set $outdoors to 0>><<effects>>
    You've reached the bottom of the hill. You sense something extremely overwhelming behind a large crude gateway.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $sandmound is 2 and $guard1 is 0>>
    As you climb deeper a guard catches your scent and approaches ready to fight.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Ready yourself|Ant Guard 1]]>><<beastNEWinit 1 ant>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $sandmound is 3 and $guard2 is 0>>
    As you climb deeper another group of guards catches your scent and approaches ready to fight.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Ready yourself|Ant Guard 2]]>><<beastNEWinit 3 ant>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $sandmound is 4 and $guard3 is 0>>
    As you climb deeper a large towering guard catches your scent and approaches ready to fight.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Ready yourself|Ant Guard 3]]>><<beastNEWinit 1 ant>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
    <<if $sandmound is 5>>
        <<wolficon>><<link [[Continue through the gate (0:05)|Ant Colony Shrine]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $sandmound is 1>>
        <<getouticon>><<link [[Leave (0:05)|Misland]]>><<pass 5>><<set $guard1 to 0>><<set $guard2 to 0>><<set $guard3 to 0>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $sandmound gte 1 and $sandmound lt 5>>
        <<link [[Delve deeper (0:05)|Anthill]]>><<set $sandmound += 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $sandmound gt 1 and $sandmound lte 5>>
        <<link [[Climb back up (0:10)|Anthill]]>><<set $sandmound -= 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
    <</if>>
<</if>>

:: Ant Colony Shrine
You come before a large wax statue. It towers over you, stretching towards the ceiling. It seems to emit an almost otherworldly buzz. A tunnel behind it leads even deeper but that does not sound like a wise choice.
<br><br>
<<wolficon>><<link [[Pray|Ant Shrine Pray]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Go deeper|Ant Nest]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Anthill]]>><</link>>

