:: Ant Guard 1 Finish
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
    The guard crumbles on the ground exhausted. 
    <br><br>
	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
    <<link [[Next|Anthill]]>><<set $guard1 to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
    <<beastejaculation>>
    The guard shifts off of you, before spitting on you. The spit hardens into a hard cocoon keeping you in place. The guard lifts you and carries you off deeper into the colony.
    <br><br>
    <<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
    <<link [[Next|Ant Kidnapped]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Ant Guard 2 Finish
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
    <<beastwound>>
    <<if $combatTrain.length gt 0>>
        The <<beasttype>> recoils in pain and fear, but another is eager for a go.
		<<combatTrainAdvance>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Ant Guard 2]]>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        The guard crumbles on the ground exhausted. 
        <br><br>
        <<tearful>> you gather yourself.
        <br><br>
        <<clotheson>>
        <<endcombat>>
        <<link [[Next|Anthill]]>><<set $guard2 to 1>><</link>>
    <</if>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax and $combatTrain.length gt 0>>
    <<beastejaculation>>
    Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> moves and another takes its turn.
	<<combatTrainAdvance>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Ant Guard 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
    <<beastejaculation>>
    One of the guards shifts off of you, before spitting on you. The spit hardens into a hard cocoon keeping you in place. The guard lifts you and carries you off deeper into the colony.
    <br><br>
    <<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
    <<link [[Next|Ant Kidnapped]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Ant Guard 3 Finish
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
    The guard crumbles on the ground exhausted. 
    <br><br>
	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
    <<link [[Next|Anthill]]>><<set $guard3 to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
    <<beastejaculation>>
    The huge guard shifts off of you, before spitting on you. The spit hardens into a hard cocoon keeping you in place. The guard lifts you and carries you off deeper into the colony.
    <br><br>
    <<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
    <<link [[Next|Ant Kidnapped]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Ant Kidnapped
You're jolted awake by the sound of thousands of feet scuttling around you. It's dark, with only a soft glow from a small tunnel that leads out of the colony. The air is thick with the acrid smell of chemicals and decay. Looking down, you realize you're lying on a pile of rotten wood and mold, covered in dozens of ants crawling over and around you. Suddenly, you realize that you're trapped in an ant hive, and that you're now a slave!
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Ant Slavery]]>><<set $antdig to 0>><</link>>

:: Ant Slavery
<<set $rng to random(1,3)>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
    It's too much for you. You pass out.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Ant Passout]]>><<passout>><</link>>
<<elseif $worn.upper.exposed gte 2 or $worn.lower.exposed gte 2>>
	<<upperwear 79>>
	<<lowerwear 71>>
    <<covered>> There's a pile of cloth scraps in an adjoining room. Some are large enough to wear.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Ant Slavery]]>><<set $eventskip to 2>><</link>>
<<elseif $rng is 3 and $eventskip isnot 1>>
    <<beastNEWinit 1 ant>>
    A <<beasttype>> attempts to mount you.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Submit quietly|Colony Ant]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Pull away|Colony Ant Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
    <<link [[Clean (1:00)|Ant Colony Clean]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Search for a way to escape (1:00)|Ant Colony Dig]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Colony Ant
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<consensual>>
	<<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].stance to "top">><<set $enemytrust -= 20>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>

<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Colony Ant Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Colony Ant]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Colony Ant Finish
<<beastejaculation>>
The <<beasttype>> clicks in satisfaction, and leaves you lying in the sand.
<br><br>
<<tearful>> you rise to your feet.
<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<set $eventskip to 2>>
<<link [[Next|Ant Slavery]]>><</link>>
<br>

